    "description": {
      "value": "Received DD No. 24-A dated 15-10-2024 regarding accident at Shankar Road T-Point at 18:20 hours. Proceeded to spot. PCR already present. Victim shifted to St. Stephen's Hospital. Accused detained at spot by Traffic Constable Mohammed Asif. Conducted preliminary inquiry at spot. Collected initial evidence. Registered FIR No. 452/2024 under sections 281/125 BNS and 184/134 MV Act on complaint of Smt. Sunita Sharma, wife of victim. Arrested accused Amit Verma at 19:15 hours from spot. Conducted personal search, prepared arrest memo. Accused sent for medical examination to RML Hospital through Constable Rajesh. Victim's MLC obtained from St. Stephen's Hospital - grievous injuries noted. IO to hospital, recorded victim's medical status. Returned to spot for detailed panchnama.\nExhibits Collected: Vehicle DL2SBP1234, DL5SCT5678, accused's mobile, both DLs, helmets\nStatements Recorded: Complaint of Sunita Sharma, Statement of HC Mohammed Asif (eyewitness), Statement of Prakash Joshi (eyewitness)",
