    "description": {
      "value": "Conducted detailed spot panchnama at Shankar Road T-Point from 21:00 to 22:15 hours in presence of panch witnesses Mohammed Asif and Prakash Joshi. Took measurements of road width (12.5m Shankar Road, 10m Rajinder Nagar Road), vehicle positions, skid marks (4.2m from Pulsar), blood stains, debris field. Identified impact point 6.5m from Shankar Road stop line. Photographed scene - 25 digital frames by HC Ramesh Kumar. Collected broken vehicle parts, helmets, delivery bag. Arranged for both vehicles to be towed to PS Malkhana yard. Noted non-functional traffic signal, 4 of 6 street lights working. Panchnama completed at 22:15 hours.\nExhibits Collected: Broken parts, helmets, delivery bag, blood samples (through hospital)\nPhotographs: 25 digital frames",
