    "description": {
      "value": "Accused Amit Verma produced before me in lock-up. Informed him of his rights under Article 20(3) of Constitution and right to legal counsel. Accused opted to give voluntary statement without lawyer. Recorded detailed statement of accused in presence of ASI Ramphal Singh as witness. Accused admitted overspeeding and stated he was in hurry to deliver Zomato order. Showed remorse. Statement recorded verbatim. Accused remanded to judicial custody. Duty Magistrate informed telephonically. Accused to be produced before Ld. MM tomorrow.\nStatements Recorded: Accused statement of Amit Verma",
