    "description": {
      "value": "Morning: Directed ASI Rajender Prasad (MTO) to conduct detailed mechanical inspection of both vehicles. Inspection conducted 10:00-13:30 in Malkhana yard. Report received - both vehicles roadworthy before accident, damage consistent with collision dynamics, Pulsar speedometer stuck at 55 kmph. Mid-day: Visited St. Stephen's Hospital security office. Collected CCTV DVR hard disk from Gate 2 camera (CAM-SSH-G2-03) covering junction. Obtained footage from 18:00-18:45 hours. Chain of custody documented. Also visited Canara Bank ATM, Shankar Road. Bank Manager Mr. S. Venkatesh provided CCTV copy on pen drive showing approach road. Obtained PCR Van Z-45 dashcam SD card from ASI Dharampal. All digital evidence submitted to HC Ramesh Kumar, Technical Cell for analysis.\nExhibits Collected: CCTV DVR (EVD-0452-013), CCTV Pen Drive (EVD-0452-014), PCR Dashcam SD (EVD-0452-015)\nReports Received: Vehicle Inspection Report from ASI Rajender Prasad",
