    "description": {
      "value": "Visited St. Stephen's Hospital SICU. Met treating doctor Dr. Anjali Mehta. Victim Rajesh Sharma still in ICU, post-surgery for femur fracture. Also underwent craniotomy for SDH evacuation on 16-10-2024 morning. Condition critical but stable. Doctor confirmed injuries are grievous in nature and dangerous to life. Obtained detailed MLC and medical records. Collected victim's blood sample for FSL (alcohol/drug screening - negative as per hospital). Met complainant Sunita Sharma at hospital, briefed her on investigation progress. Advised her to preserve all medical bills and records for court.\nDocuments Obtained: MLC Report, Admission records, Surgery notes",
